# fuzzgen -- the findings the fixed-seed run of `zfuzz --generate` in `make ci`
# is known to show, each a signature in `findings`, from the run of `seed` with
# `cases` programs. Each is a defect not fixed yet. The run fails on a
# signature not listed here, and on a listed one it no longer shows: fix the
# defect and delete its line in the same change. `make fuzz-gen-known` writes
# this file from a run.

seed: 11
cases: 320
findings: list {} out staticlist text
